{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "44fe2ca8019b23954c78b4c422ee5d8d770bc2b3fc8dc0912348c9ad4fe44f10", "ja": "誇り", "zh": "引以为傲", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8ded770b955bc48c7fc96afc9817d5683d0a48d1265d047c3d57041a0988d9a1", "ja": "美希、響、貴音の3人はライブに向けて親睦\nを深めようとお泊まり会を開催。食事の後に\n後輩達の公演をDVDで鑑賞し、みんなの成長\nを喜びつつ寂しがる響。自分達もいい公演に\nしようと思いを新たにする。", "zh": "为了演唱会，美希、响和贵音三人想加深\n彼此的感情，决定一起过夜。吃完饭后，\n响观赏着后辈们的公演DVD，为大家的成长\n感到既开心又寂寞，同时再次下定决心要和\n伙伴们一起带来精采的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "620b294e526d88b94fe52a1425b5c8e1ab683da5f7251a85424b0a5157572431", "ja": "よし、準備オッケー！　これだけ作れば、\nさすがの貴音達もお腹いっぱいになってくれるよね！", "zh": "好，准备OK！都做了这么多，\n就算是贵音她们，一定也能吃饱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "1f889f3326778b647a63fd1a97beb68b5b52933f86f706412f823bc26fa7e5d5", "ja": "ヘビ香はケージに入れたし、\n後は、ふたりが来るのを待つだけだけど……。", "zh": "蛇香也放进笼子里了，\n接下来只要等她们抵达……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1002_null", "source_sha256": "38bf7559fb8d669d4caa1bd285e24bc8bd477848c03123f183f1d873f9a2abef", "ja": "ぴんぽーん", "zh": "叮咚～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "7cc79940ebb0c2b2f4b84b9e6ecbed480aa74212fb12138627fa224062a44c73", "ja": "あ、来た来た！　はーいっ！", "zh": "啊，来了来了！马上来──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "1937cba73c7f370f8c0f8ef9442d10d22fdda613b085eeb38feaeac9120d90d1", "ja": "おいしい～☆\n響のおにぎり、とってもおいしいの！", "zh": "好好吃～☆\n响做的饭团真好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "815a59669b8443a261aa75ae5f08aff230c0d497bdb65c4fa2b69b1bee0e225c", "ja": "でしょでしょ！？　それは、ポークたまごおにぎり！\n沖縄で人気のおにぎりなんだ！", "zh": "对吧对吧！？这是猪肉蛋饭团！\n是冲绳很受欢迎的饭团！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "fbf39637c9a580330ffdaf2db150132bcc260b16f8695a9d9812bc9f82bfba2d", "ja": "まだまだいっぱい作ってあるから、\nどんどん食べてよね！", "zh": "本人做了很多，\n你们尽量吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "41bd92a0d009327156fa5f929d03b3280c703032521d8cb1a458195a2577c4e9", "ja": "ふん、はひはほー（うん、ありがとー）！", "zh": "呜，嘿嘿──（嗯，谢谢──）！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "f34baad08636fb7928875fb06620e36bd496a80cc283f5bf894eb585c2649e2d", "ja": "どんどん食べて……。\nつまりそれは、私への挑戦ですね？", "zh": "尽量吃……\n这是在对小女子下战帖对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "630737cf47e84ad705c766ee09bb0651ed98751c9838fd80d9b3ded0c48672d3", "ja": "違うぞ。\nもーっ、貴音が言ったんでしょ？", "zh": "不是啦，很讨厌耶，\n这不是贵音你自己说的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "63e2fa0f0cd9b435ebbc18c0143f98cfc1ba77963d72428f043fbc7f1142457a", "ja": "オールスターライブを成功させるために、今日は3人で\n同じ釜の飯を食べて、もっと仲良くなろうって！", "zh": "为了让群星演唱会成功，\n今天我们三个要同吃一锅饭，增进感情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "5fdc9e32115d306add12f978b0fb87db2d625238618b1f2c3d0107bbf180b040", "ja": "ふふっ、もちろんわかっていますよ、響。\n今のはほんのたわむれ……。お許しください。", "zh": "呵呵，这小女子当然明白，响。\n刚才那是开个玩笑……还请见谅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "9c3406056de04b71152563dd6ae0967517be12df37b5c916aa8cc7cd2d614370", "ja": "それでは、あらためて……。\nお代わり頂戴いたします。", "zh": "那么这就正式说一次……\n请再给小女子一份。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "482b9deac40afa879be6cfe14c4610bc36cff36cf835e1fc5c4ea9bcf6a66216", "ja": "ええっ、もう全部食べちゃったの！？\nあれから5分もたってないぞ！？", "zh": "咦咦？你都吃完了！？\n从刚才到现在还没五分钟耶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "d51395349052411fb765a43b4b5df15674957a7f449da841090181c8d6820e2f", "ja": "唐揚げの入ったおにぎりもおいしかったの～♪\nミキ、とーっても幸せ☆　あはっ！", "zh": "加了炸鸡块的饭团也好好吃唷～♪\n美希好幸福☆啊哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "97facc8352a30bc79970a9846615b6b909d1a68fdb7b9d150888e46ccd9a1bc7", "ja": "買い置きしてあった食材、全部使ったのに……。\nふたりとも食べ過ぎじゃないか！？", "zh": "本人明明把多买的食材都用掉了……\n你们两个会不会吃太多了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "0c427ee0a7d3a0d239fee262cf4fd38dc1e9ade566587a6c94c5f8a0cc94b71a", "ja": "真、美味でした。", "zh": "因为着实相当美味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "2e6a9f553ce64f9a1eb5b6b89a346d047701f278d792231fb51928f452283dfd", "ja": "響のおにぎりって、昴くんのと同じくらい\nおいしいよね。さすがなの！", "zh": "响做的饭团跟阿昴做的一样好吃呢，\n好了不起唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "9dee64e82acadfccc0714f5f09b0fd51b3c6481d9b7005f0e864cc40840dd341", "ja": "え？　ま、まあ、自分は料理もカンペキだから……\nって、昴も料理が上手なの？", "zh": "咦？对、对啊，因为本人连厨艺也无懈可击……\n咦？昴的厨艺也很棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "e21947971e4fda91aa49986e276e1d74573f70e8d3039b19347243a43947a5a8", "ja": "うん、おウチでよくお手伝いとかしてるんだって。\nミキは全然してないけど☆", "zh": "嗯，她说在家常常帮忙。\n美希完全不会下厨就是了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "cb3b4f05f8e6d4eb1a5d97defa770e26648f338c56ac7e85d3fb02903a8ae373", "ja": "そっかー。劇場ができてからずいぶんたったけど、\nまだ知らないこと、たくさんあるんだな～。", "zh": "这样啊～虽然剧场已经成立一段时间了，\n但还有很多事都不知道呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "9a3f35cba976e73753dfe372446ff69f510b628011c8ccb529d8dd0f61923d71", "ja": "では……食事も終えたことですし、\n皆でこれを鑑賞いたしませんか。", "zh": "那么……也用完餐了，\n大家要不要一同观赏这个呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "d23ac3878fdd51b9300223b768f53ac5424d17e3af81e453f20de0be7cea9986", "ja": "え？　これってDVD？　……あ、もしかして、\nこの間のみんなの公演の！？", "zh": "咦？这是DVD吗？\n……啊，该不会是之前大家公演那场吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "6046eaa0225a000ccc58a724527deb8795f2da01e8d70a22659c59e0f18bce83", "ja": "はい。先日、\n{$P$}からいただいたものです。", "zh": "是的，\n这是前几天{$P$}提供的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "4e38ebd588f1f09953b6017c46eb7857e99a6b85b63e5a57d890d47b57b784fc", "ja": "うん、観る観る！\n自分、あの日は仕事で行けなかったんだよねっ。", "zh": "嗯，要看要看！\n本人那天因为工作没办法去看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "461c518ffc5a75c402ad3ffed736819c171eed87bbb9fdc72e3ca9160e558232", "ja": "自分たちもライブ前だから参考になりそうだし。\nえへへ、後輩たちの活躍、自分が確かめてやるさーっ！", "zh": "我们也快办演唱会了，应该颇有参考价值。\n嘿嘿，本人要来看看后辈们的精采表演啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "0d54da2a9602f54918f07edd0c5f309e0e2d4107695589de5175580e7db7a5a5", "ja": "むむむ～……。", "zh": "唔唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "faa99b2572cf3272d2e7d272423aad2acb59c08a6a07575165cba84ea5e8ad40", "ja": "響？　どうしたの？", "zh": "响？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "8d1e0980ddd255e79be0001916550a8820777e863b92b4d559adee6e9f7a89a1", "ja": "いや、どうしたっていうか……。\nみんな、けっこうスゴくないか？", "zh": "不，也不是什么大事……\n不觉得大家看起来都很厉害吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "e02072601eb991f8a8f37976a1bab4ac4455e1092e1cc5020c89f1c0c0880fee", "ja": "うん♪　みんな、すっごく\nキラキラしてるって思うな♪", "zh": "嗯♪\n美希觉得大家都在闪闪发光呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "b4011f74fedda19dab92111bcd91fa0dba762268b1f9ce45d5fbbc2bfc32e791", "ja": "自分、みんなにはスゴいアイドルになって\n欲しいって、ずっと思ってたけど……", "zh": "虽然本人一直希望大家能成为厉害的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1032_008tak", "source_sha256": "645b58591b06ddc072c9a1876d0d3ed5d435f743153d970f402d2afbcba4ba5d", "ja": "私もです。\nですから今も、誇らしい気持ちでいっぱいです。", "zh": "小女子也是，\n所以现在心中充满了骄傲的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "66bf2f967820cb574a5accde55662dc0ed5566d376a0c3770aea521c4ee82c3d", "ja": "自分もそうなんだけど！　でも……。\nなんだか、ちょっと寂しい気もするぞ……。", "zh": "本人也是这样！但是……\n总觉得也有点寂寞呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1034_003mik", "source_sha256": "6017fe4a344fb7ce1843a2e76dbff276f608b690dd1c4f417559989e35957693", "ja": "寂しい？　どうして？", "zh": "寂寞？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "a8c4067ee0ec39cf5bd6a63ae6b7d00dcde3a6e2ba270f3a6697f080dd3c7bf2", "ja": "だって～！　みんながスゴくなっちゃったら、\n自分が教えること、なくなっちゃうでしょ？", "zh": "因为～！要是大家都变厉害了，\n本人不就没有东西可以教了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "0d2c42890f708752a9c4ea4050abf4256dd3576eff1972a0ce2d1d1b68900e03", "ja": "自分、ホントはまだ、センパイぶってたいのに～！", "zh": "本人其实还想继续摆摆前辈的架子耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1037_008tak", "source_sha256": "bf0031c0bd9efe602ea5cc7d9a196412cb3d37ad0d97e4eb3066827680913b56", "ja": "まあ……。それはまた、なんとも……。\n響らしいことです。ふふっ。", "zh": "哎呀……这实在是……\n很像响会有的想法，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1038_003mik", "source_sha256": "cd6b3f1e41424f34e95dd1e905fff07faa5eb27eb313ad419245ba3124dc2554", "ja": "あはっ、カッコ悪いの☆", "zh": "啊哈，好逊喔☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "aaae911541e4d651e98254678d361dfbcbb7001e15d7efa0801d6447e31b7fe9", "ja": "いいでしょ別に～っ。\n……あ、そうだ！　いいこと思いついた！", "zh": "有什么关系嘛～\n……啊，对了！本人想到一个好点子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1040_013hib", "source_sha256": "96bf7735b635b3c2ce2f0047702e9f9c8eab0b222ca521a9ec35abd98e485e3e", "ja": "自分、今度のオールスターライブを、\nカンペキ中のカンペキなステージにしてみせるっ！", "zh": "本人要让这次的群星演唱会，\n成为完美中的完美表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1041_013hib", "source_sha256": "cf6e1cc233af2dbe7fe8d57717b4691db0fcf49537a3c846399f2b40273a02fd", "ja": "そしたら「さすがセンパイ！」みたいな感じで、\n劇場のみんなにも見直してもらえるよねっ！？", "zh": "然后剧场的大家就会觉得「真不愧是前辈！」\n然后对本人另眼相看对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1042_008tak", "source_sha256": "90cba6bebe143515de231166c1d2eef6057f841931cbc55a93feeacb31d6ab66", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね。それに……", "zh": "呵呵，说得没错，而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1043_008tak", "source_sha256": "e30a22e94245adc9f2da139b040cac45616f20eda0c9bc9d83beb1a5a62f57dc", "ja": "そのように、常に仲間の目標であろうとする\n響のことも、私は誇らしく思います。", "zh": "像这样，总是想成为伙伴们标竿的响，\n也令小女子感到骄傲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1044_013hib", "source_sha256": "56d6306c1bb86d9a4d282cb4d9e99fba998782ef154e9a76404034a867539f87", "ja": "えっ！　じ、自分は貴音の後輩じゃないんだから、\n誇らなくてもいいでしょ！？", "zh": "咦！？本、本人又不是贵音的后辈，\n用不着感到骄傲吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1045_008tak", "source_sha256": "788326610415af92e9e8c59119e1538ec8fd6ad9258a37694e8b3044e3a05466", "ja": "申し訳ありませんが……我慢してください。\n貴女という仲間がいることが、誇らしいのです。", "zh": "非常抱歉……但请你忍耐。\n有你这样的伙伴，小女子感到非常骄傲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1046_013hib", "source_sha256": "91569d4509022b4d6dfade15514da252980e404c7f667f16d7296739f239018a", "ja": "な、仲間……仲間なら……って、やっぱり、\n恥ずかしいからダメだってば～！", "zh": "伙、伙伴……如果是伙伴……\n不，感觉还是很难为情，别这样啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1047_003mik", "source_sha256": "d3b62fe613d688038e9fa9d0c038c62b414399a9bebcd56721b89cd548410e8a", "ja": "でも、そうだね！　響のいう通りかも。", "zh": "但没错呢！也许就跟响说的一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1048_013hib", "source_sha256": "0dc3d0cfaba6b3c86c0b6c24e966af50910538b129894e95e62c7d939b698a0e", "ja": "うぎゃー！　美希まで自分をからかう気！？", "zh": "呜呀──！连美希都要捉弄本人吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1049_003mik", "source_sha256": "d9fd1d2d8b3c33820d2e71bf0082c3606ee93e46d2b8fc1cc2e509c4dc072df4", "ja": "あはっ、そんなんじゃないの！\nミキ的には……ただ、負けないってだけ！", "zh": "啊哈，不是这样的！\n美希……只是不想输而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1050_003mik", "source_sha256": "f91ee73effbf66eadb7cb02c27458bcd46b397b750d2b982a15e140e1fb86a79", "ja": "だからー。今度のライブもミキたちで、\n最高のライブにしようね！", "zh": "所以～\n美希我们也要让这次的演唱会成为最棒的演唱会喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1051_013hib", "source_sha256": "6924805f73d8f95ae6c519aa51b0e76e8bcc66941958afc87614bf027cf820ce", "ja": "美希……。", "zh": "美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1052_008tak", "source_sha256": "4c5ce8f529c6556e910a55463e38f824295f59a42495355b87254d13e2b4af33", "ja": "……そうですね。では、\nこれまでもそうしてきたように。", "zh": "……说得没错。\n那么，就像一直以来一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1053_008tak", "source_sha256": "37c3e8574a7a97b8f07cac7eb44d3840203af15e8f8651f0136f3438b364a6ca", "ja": "美希、響。共に遥かな高みを目指しましょう！", "zh": "美希、响，继续跟小女子一同朝遥远的巅峰前进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1054_003mik", "source_sha256": "bd19161a245b5bf7b74279fae432dbbe527da7deb9d1e0ba7a0c71daa00ca4ed", "ja": "……うん。", "zh": "……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_05_1055_013hib", "source_sha256": "43e2d2f8bb2171e156a4205f31cd3372a22fc46a2dc604bb16f113903e79f2e6", "ja": "……うんっ！", "zh": "……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
